      <h1>Industries</h1>
      <p class="lead">Many sectors hold records that AI teams find useful. Each one brings its own rights and personal-data questions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section mist">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="inline-cards">
        <div class="card reveal" id="professional-services">
        <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="icons.svg#i-briefcase"/></svg></span>
        <h2>Professional services</h2>
          <p>Advisory, legal and consulting work: proposals, deliverables and client correspondence.</p>
          <p class="muted small-note"><strong>Check first:</strong> client confidentiality and privilege.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" id="software-and-saas">
        <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="icons.svg#i-code"/></svg></span>
        <h2>Software and SaaS</h2>
          <p>Tickets, pull requests and product discussions that show how problems were solved.</p>
          <p class="muted small-note"><strong>Check first:</strong> customer terms and third-party licenses.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="icons.svg#i-box"/></svg></span>
        <h2>Manufacturing and operations</h2>
          <p>Work orders, quality logs and maintenance records from day-to-day production.</p>
          <p class="muted small-note"><strong>Check first:</strong> supplier contracts and any site-specific restrictions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="icons.svg#i-cart"/></svg></span>
        <h2>Retail and e-commerce</h2>
          <p>Customer service threads, product reviews and order-handling notes.</p>
          <p class="muted small-note"><strong>Check first:</strong> customer personal data.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="icons.svg#i-shield"/></svg></span>
        <h2>Healthcare-adjacent</h2>
          <p>Administrative and operational records that contain no clinical content.</p>
          <p class="muted small-note"><strong>Check first:</strong> any health-related data, which carries strict rules. We review these case by case.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
        <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="icons.svg#i-pin"/></svg></span>
        <h2>Logistics and field services</h2>
          <p>Dispatch notes, incident logs and scheduling records built up over time.</p>
          <p class="muted small-note"><strong>Check first:</strong> driver and customer details.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
